<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 4.397 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 4.397 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 4.397 billion pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday through five auctions to purchase paper, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    1.000 bln  17 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   9 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   6 days</p>
<p>	698 million   2 days</p>
<p>	699 million   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
